      "round": 2,
      "snapshot_ref": "ab641e93900ddddcaeaa19d323f33fa9045ef9d0",
      "owner": "frontend",
      "severity": "low",
      "blocking": false,
      "summary": "The Active tab sends `status=active` by default (`model.ts` `buildProjectsQuery`). A v6 backend does not know this parameter. If it ignores it, the \"Active\" tab shows every project, closed ones included, with no marker. If it rejects unknown query parameters, the list shows the error card. The client does not filter and shows no status, so it cannot tell. Please record this as a coordination point with the backend developer, or send `status` only when the page has seen `counts` (which the list cannot know before the first read).",
